{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2f00142dfd7715f0d1739c7362a5ffce4f6c7fecabc7170865928c30a923294d","ja":"オススメのお店","zh":"推荐的店铺","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5a36a906c391fd8acbe6350fa4eb10ebe86d6e6af9a60b88e5a5739641114ce3","ja":"みんなは、ショッピングモールで\nイベントに出演していて……","zh":"大家正在商业综合体\n参加活动演出……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bcb0b5b52037277b09787b7a3fcca8e7e6a6f380c6455d03caa3ba7db8061d85","ja":"実は少し前に、みんなでこのショッピングモールに、\nお買い物にきたことがあるんですよ～。","zh":"其实不久前，大家曾经一起来过\n这家购物中心买东西哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2e311bb4c38e48a92d38791c1119abed3348f0aa6f020523b6e3bab553543669","ja":"最初の予定と、全然違う感じになっちゃいましたけど、\nすっごく楽しかったで～す！　ね、紬さん♪","zh":"虽然跟最初的预定完全不一样了，\n但真的超开心～呢！对吧，紬小姐♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fc4615eb63a33380430117f28d14c5295b3f2a3550e12917c19a6612f3564294","ja":"そうですね。機会があればまた、今度は伊吹さんと\n木下さんの考えたプランで、遊びに来たいです。","zh":"也是呢。如果还有机会，下次希望能按照\n伊吹和木下想出的方案再来玩。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"5fc2b949390bed81053b3946cb0c7e94d61ebfb52b939dc3191739bda6cc22c1","ja":"みんなも、オススメのお店があれば、\nぜひ教えてほしいべさ。","zh":"大家如果有推荐的店，\n也一定要告诉我呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1ce73566c41d19e5ecdfafc323714e9d0ee59aa20fd7ecb2c24ae27041bfa85e","ja":"もしかしたら、アタシたちがそのお店に\n買い物しに行っちゃうかも、しれませんよ！","zh":"说不定我们也会去那家店\n买东西也说不定哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"d3175ed9dffaf4af1a795a213c996a03fcacfebe04bd24f3bcb6a8cb563a1aff","ja":"そして、イベント終了後……","zh":"然后，在活动结束后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"0f89fb936c15150c34ce3aac4c8447218619e1fb37bacc6c5c18b930c4f41e4a","ja":"見てください！　ファンの人達がSNSに、\nオススメのお店を、いっぱい紹介してくれてますよ～！","zh":"您看！粉丝们在社交平台上，\n给我们推荐了好多值得去的好店呢～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a74206c30b6804957afd12f33badee20d16c9644c51838fba2d7be9597863025","ja":"すごい……アピールポイントとかオススメ商品とか、\nめちゃくちゃ細かく書いてくれてるじゃん！","zh":"好厉害……宣传要点和推荐商品之类的，\n写得超级详细嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"c060d1412497de08ced3f1dcde56192af0e98a4d03148131b2ee743fd3fe17a7","ja":"みんな、紹介が上手だねぇ。\nどのお店も魅力的で、目移りしちゃうべさ……。","zh":"大家介绍得都好棒啊。\n每家店都很有魅力，让人眼花缭乱呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"56d1cdcee186e029267a001a57f44f9627a8865a5422e6826ce2c14b2ce2d6d1","ja":"本当に……。\n気になるお店がどんどん増えてしまいます。","zh":"真的……。\n在意的店铺不知不觉间变得越来越多了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"54aa7ade00dc15cbf1a7b22ef3e63bb659dbb786a5f51d4e137fac50e10aef66","ja":"それなら、このあとさっそく、\nまたモールで遊んでいかない？","zh":"既然这样，待会儿要不要立刻\n再去商场玩玩？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"e6dde913fd30f14d82adc90ad6239beea64f63414491de24a100e625e6b786cd","ja":"今日の仕事は、これで終わりだし！","zh":"今天的工作就到此结束啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"9b9b07310af0cde0ecc6b95cacfe2f753e23abd142b18bee3d826d2cfc151ba5","ja":"さんせ～い♪　でも、●●●●プロデューサーさんも\n一緒だったらよかったのにな～。","zh":"赞～成♪ 不过，要是●●●●制作人也能\n一起来就好了呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"8ea9b5a76b623f65e59be375ca0de9f95426c55a4fdc553e4724d6dea8f3328b","ja":"別の仕事が入ってるからって、慌ただしく\n出てっちゃったもんね。仕方ないよ。","zh":"因为还有别的工作，走得\n急急忙忙的呢。这也是没办法的事。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"4f84692148f24bce35306898a8fd7d3247e5802b6a3ba2284aa275129a0d25b2","ja":"いつも、忙しそうですよね～。\nちゃんと、休んでるのかな……。","zh":"平时好像一直很忙呢～。\n真的有在好好休息吗……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1484.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"1f7140eca7cfd1eb0b4bced5f2d7622f7a7e90b0b727c36c40f7a8ad6d86a2db","ja":"（あっ、そうだ！\nお土産買っていったら、元気になってもらえるかも♪）","zh":"（啊，对了！\n要是买点特产回去，说不定能让她打起精神来呢♪）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
